abstract: >-
  A unified research edition of German radio cryptograms in Childs's 1918
  collection, including the 22 Lasry-Schmeh challenge entries and other
  source-reviewed messages, with attributed earlier decipherments, new
  readings, explicit editorial hypotheses, and independently reproducible
  coordinate-level certificates.
